{
  "$comment": [
    "Urdu digits use EXTENDED Arabic-Indic (U+06F0-U+06F9), not Arabic-Indic",
    "(U+0660-U+0669). The blocks look identical for most digits but four, six",
    "and seven are drawn differently: Urdu uses ۴ ۶ ۷ where Arabic uses",
    "٤ ٦ ٧. Using the wrong block is a silent, easy mistake that produces",
    "digits an Urdu reader will not recognise."
  ],
